| Full  | fuel (tb)  | 0.054 | 0.069 | 0.087 | 0.115 | 0.140 | 0.9 % | 0.29 | +0.0007 | 0.031 |
| Full  | chip (ct)  | 0.065 | 0.067 | 0.109 | 0.148 | 0.179 | 1.2 % | 0.42 | +0.0016 | 0.034 |
## sigma is jumps, not diffusion: ~1 % of edge-weeks change, by ~25-40 % when they do; spread grows ~sqrt(h) up to h=4
